      "text": "You're right. The upper body and back. Yeah, you could be right about that. So those things that, because you trained back, they're in like a highlighted floating box kind of towards the top, and it says AI Coach. So I'm just going to go ahead and select one, and we're back to How do you feel? So I'm going to do that for a third time. I feel I'm good. And so now it's just the spinal rotation stretch, and it says left, and then it's right, and now it asks me, How do I feel again? I feel good. And now we're back to the same thing, and it's the same thing. It's just the outline of the box up at the top and AI Coach with the same three things: child pose, seated spinal twist, and spinal rotation. Which is interesting because the spinal rotation and the seated spinal twist use the same photo reference. So that's not really correct, is it?\n",
