      "text": "So I just went back into the activity thing just to see if there's anything different since I logged some stretching and stuff. There's nothing different in here, and I just, I gotta say, I just don't like the activity thing because it's like activity performance, activity coaching, and it's like, and then under performance, there's activities and then there's cardio. It's like what's... I mean, I don't see a reason for all this. But, you know, maybe it's there. I don't know. Activities, you know, it's like dancing. Okay, that's cool. Hiking. Okay, that's cool. Interval walking. Now let's see what cardio is considered though. Cardio is StairMaster, cycling, cross training, rowing machine, rowing moderate pace, StairMaster. Yeah, the activity screen just doesn't seem that well fleshed out. I don't know. It could use some simplifying maybe.\n",
