      "capturedAt": "2026-10-21T14:00:47.076Z",
      "text": "I take that back. It said it was done, and I approved it, and then it went back to building it and said that it had a minute more to go. So that's just a minor language thing within the prompt that it shows you. It says it's done, and then you approve it, and then it goes back to building. I think maybe it needs, like, finalize or something like that.\n",
