      "text": "It says it understood what I was doing, and so it had enough context, and it wanted me to rebuild the entire product, or build, which is, you know, back to that, like, four- to five-minute building process. And it just says, You're on Pro now. You hit the limit, so I switched you to Pro at no cost. Nothing else changes. Your programs, workouts, and history are still here. So I guess I just hit a usage limit, but as of right now, there's still no cost.\n",
